OL,3,AI've been with my boyfriend for two
OL,4,Ayears and don't know his salary
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou know their favourite restaurant,
OL,7,Fwhat happened with their ex and their
OL,8,Fmost embarrassing childhood story. But
OL,9,Fdo you know how much your partner
OL,10,Fearns?
OL,12,FMoney remains one of dating's trickier
OL,13,Fconversations. Bring it up too early
OL,14,Fand it can sound like you're sizing up
OL,15,Ftheir bank balance. But leave it too
OL,16,Flong and you could be planning a future
OL,17,Fwith someone without knowing much about
OL,18,Ftheir finances at all.
OL,20,FWe spoke to 20-somethings in New York
OL,21,FCity to see if there was a sweet spot
OL,22,Ffor when to talk salaries.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
