OL,3,AI've been with my boyfriend for two
OL,4,Ayears and don't know his salary
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilla Morton, 25, says she doesn't
OL,7,Fthink couples necessarily need to
OL,8,Freveal their salaries at all.
